# Agent working material — planning, skills and prompt scaffolding.
#
# Only application code and product documentation are published. These are the
# working notes of how the code got written, not part of the product: specs,
# BMAD epics and stories, per-feature implementation plans, and the skills
# installer both coding agents share. They stay local by request.
/bmad-output/
/docs/superpowers/
/docs/plans/
/docs/AGENT_SKILLS.md
/tool/prompts/
/tool/bootstrap_skills.sh
/tool/skills.manifest.json
/docs/DEX_DIFFERENTIAL_REVIEW_*.md
